{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は名古屋で全国ツアーがありました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"熱気が凄くて\nたくさん汗かいたっ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年入って1番汗かいた1日でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の公演で\n今年のツアーの折り返し地点と\n聞いてびっくり！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっという間ですね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時間が経つのがはやくて\n毎日必死に食らいつくことしかできてない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しんでるけどね！毎日！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/08/8426732/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/08/8426732/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いおりと楽屋いつもとなりなの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶対となりなの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/08/8426732/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らじらー！終わりました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"